{
  "description": "the sliced block of fillet-cut-gap with its top pushed out by 0.3 instead: the upper strip of blend is dragged along, its radius to 2.3 about the same axis, and meets the fixed oblique flat on a line further up it \u2014 a dragged face's sharp edge with a face that stays, found as their section; the lower strip and the front, tangent to each other but not to the top, stay",
